			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100100301,
					"content": "这里、怎么，怎么有这么多奇怪的东西…还有好多丘丘人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100302,
					"content": "不如说，感觉就是丘丘人把这些奇怪的东西搬到这儿来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100303,
					"content": "唔，原来这就是试炼里的「丛丛障碍」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100304,
					"content": "虽然读得很相近，但其实是「重重障碍」啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100305,
					"content": "不过，按照纸条的提示，我们要找的东西应该在这些「重重障碍」下面…有什么别的提示吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100306,
					"content": "这个时候难道没有什么「嘟嘟可的指引」之类的东西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100307,
					"content": "没有哦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100308,
					"content": "啊…那要怎么办？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
