					"nextDialogs": [
						100100806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100806,
					"content": "是一顶小小的帽子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100807,
					"content": "是给嘟嘟可的帽子！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100808,
					"content": "在嘟嘟一族之中，只有更加特别，更加了不起的嘟嘟可，才能被「嘟嘟大魔王」承认！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100809,
					"content": "这些了不起的嘟嘟可肩负着帮助和保护别的嘟嘟可的职责，所以「嘟嘟大魔王」赐予他们特殊的帽子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100810,
					"content": "这样，别的嘟嘟可就能认出他们，然后遇到没办法解决的困难，就找到他们寻求帮助。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100811,
					"content": "哦，那嘟嘟可就会变成戴帽子的嘟嘟可啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100812,
					"content": "嗯！成为戴帽子的嘟嘟可就是「嘟嘟大魔法师」…就能用大魔法师的火花力量帮助更多的人了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100813,
					"content": "可莉——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100814,
					"content": "骑士团的人说，城外的森林里又传来了特别大的爆炸声…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100815,
					"content": "#荣誉骑士{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}，小派蒙，现在是可莉需要帮助…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100816,
					"content": "啊，我可以作证，我们和可莉一起清除了聚集的丘丘人，还有史莱姆，而且我们是为了完成「课题」才来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100817,
					"content": "小派蒙说得一点没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100818,
					"content": "那这里的鱼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100819,
					"content": "那是刚才对付湖上的坏家伙的时候，可莉不小心炸到的…跟以前可不一样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100820,
					"content": "也就是说，以前都是故意炸的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100821,
					"content": "可莉因为以前炸的鱼无话可说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100822,
					"content": "…唉，我来的路上已经看到了，被摧毁的魔物营地，以及刚才从星落湖边上跑走的魔物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100823,
					"content": "#没有造成其他的破坏吧，{NICKNAME}？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100824,
						100100826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100824,
					"content": "其他的破坏都是派蒙造成的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100825
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100100825,
					"content": "…对对，都是我一口气吹出来的，我了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
